[BEGIN]
  ObjTp=Hd
  Cmn1=Date v1.0\\\\Builds Full_Date from the processor clock. Four parameters||1
  Cmn2=spell the day\\of week, the day of the month, the month, and the||1
  Cmn3=year. Each can be Off.\\Final_Format is the date shape. Week_Format||1
  Cmn4=is where "Week n" sits, or Off.\\Neither one replaces the spellings.
  Cmn5=\\\\Spelling and date-shape names are pictures. Week Format uses||1
  Cmn6=<date> for\\the date those dropdowns build. The live string uses||1
  Cmn7=today's date and the\\spellings you picked. Tie Refresh to a When||1
  Cmn8=at midnight. Full_Date also\\publishes at startup, and again when||1
  Cmn9=a latched override changes.\\\\An override is ignored until a value||1
  Cmn10=arrives after startup. After that, the\\analog is the setting, and||1
  Cmn11=0 is Off (or the first date shape, for\\Final_Format).\\\\Press||1
  Cmn12=F1 for Date v1.0.html. Leave that file next to this module.\\\\v1.
  Cmn13=0  2026-10-26\\- Initial module
[END]
